research/audit/wave14-dispatch/audit-beta-a1a2.log:10851:## thm-exponential-limits-and-range
research/audit/wave14-dispatch/audit-beta-a1a2.log:10860:L2 -> thm-exponential-limits-and-range [Statement;1]: $$\exp(x)\to+\infty\quad(x\to+\infty),\qquad \exp(x)\to0\quad(x\to-\infty),$$ and the range of $\exp$ is contained in $(0,\infty)$ and is unbounded above with infimum $0$.
